Slack Notifications:
--------------------
    - send build status to team (success, failure, aborted)

    Flow:
    -----
        create slack chanel
        install slack plugin in jenkins
        configure token
        use in pipeline

    Declarative Example:
    --------------------
        post {
            success {
                slackSend message: "Build Success"
            }
            failure {
                slackSend message: "Build Failed"
            }
        }